  "details": "As I saw, at least these are two locations using this string:\n\n1. Action menu > Options > personal mirror > settings > Face mirror > Zoon\n\n2. Camera Dolly > camera anchor menus > Zoom & Focus > Zoom\n\nThey are two usage:\n\n1. Resize the image of face mirror\n\n2. Zoom in and zoom out camera lens\n\nThey are some different in translation. For \"Face mirror\", we spell it as \"resize image\" but for camera it should be \"zoom in and zoom out with camera lens\" so it is different.\n\nThe first one (for face mirror) should be split.",
